OL,3,GNEWSA'My footballer brother hid his
OL,4,Asexuality for years'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe sister of a former footballer who
OL,7,Fvanished for decades because he could
OL,8,Fnot discuss his homosexuality with his
OL,9,Ffamily hopes a new film will give
OL,10,Fothers strength.
OL,12,FDenise Smith said her brother Tony
OL,13,FPowell, a former Bath City, Bournemouth
OL,14,Fand Norwich City player cut all ties in
OL,15,F1981 while he was playing football in
OL,16,Fthe USA.
OL,18,FHe was found in 2002 to be a motel
OL,19,Fmanager in California, and despite his
OL,20,Ffamily's efforts to contact him he did
OL,21,Fnot speak to them until just a few
OL,22,Fyears ago.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
